# Changelog

All notable changes to this catalogue are recorded here. The format follows
[Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/), and the project follows
[Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

A heading is `## [X.Y.Z] - YYYY-MM-DD`, and that grammar is load-bearing rather than
cosmetic: it is the version site `radar check-version-sites` compares against
`pyproject.toml`, so a heading written some other way is a version site that has quietly
stopped existing.

WHAT BELONGS HERE, and what does not. This file records changes to what the repository
ships as SOFTWARE - the paths named by `[changelog].prefixes` in `radar.toml`. It does not
record catalogue content: a ring transition carries its own dated `[[history]]` entry with
its reason inside the tool's own file, which is a better record than a changelog line
because the gate can read it.

